             // `finalize_each` finishes its final block side by side via
             // `ffi_output::input`. Everywhere else (including plain mode in
             // `update_each` on x86-64 and all modes on AArch64) the first chunk
             // is staged so `finalize_each` hashes all blocks of short plain
